{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michael \u201cLucky Flash\u201d Foster, a university student and part-time courier  spends his days racing city streets with a van full of packages and a schedule full of chaos. At Speed Deliveries, every package carries a story \u2014 and every stop holds a possibility. Guide Lucky Flash through a day-job full of memorable encounters. Balance routes, banter, and relationships in a cozy slice-of-life world where love and passion show up in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What's inside:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intimate, character-driven story (with a touch of humour) set in the warmth (and chaos) of everyday working life, wrapped around romantic subplots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple branching paths and affection-based endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Distinct personalities and richly written dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stunning artwork and animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126410?t=1768642459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126410?t=1768642459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126410/3ccc508e2a04aeeabaeda53e14e81f02a32a924d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768642459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126410/3ccc508e2a04aeeabaeda53e14e81f02a32a924d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768642459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is for ADULTS only and it includes nudity and sexual content. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old + all sexual acts are consensual."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michael \u201cLucky Flash\u201d Foste